# PHP

`declare(strict_types=1);` Pint PSR-12. Final classes like the rest of `app/`.

- Inject `SolaClient`, `AbonentSession`, `ViewFactory`. Do not new up HTTP in a controller.
- Sign the **exact** JSON bytes. Encode once. Do not add `lang` to `/tariff/connect`.
- `/identify` (SMS) and `/verify` are not retried. Reads may retry on `ConnectionException` only (`throw: false` so HTTP 400 stays a `SolaResponse`).
- `SolaUnavailableException` → global 503. Do not wrap every SOLA call.
- Validation only in FormRequests. Flash `flashInfo` / `flashDanger`. User errors via `ErrorMessages` + `lang/*/errors.php`.
- `"0000-00-00"` → null (Carbon year -1). Year `< 2000` is unset.
- Fake billing attaches to the HTTP factory in **local** only.

```php
// ❌ BAD
$som = $info->get('saldo') / 100;
$charge = $profile->nextChargeDate() ?? now()->addMonth();

// ✅ GOOD
$som = $profile->balance();           // already soʻm
$charge = $profile->nextChargeDate(); // null → omit the block
```
